  "id": "integrated-care",
  "term": "integrated care",
  "definition": "Integrated care is an approach to health and social care that tries to meet complex needs through coordinated, collaborative service delivery across settings. It brings together hospitals with services such as community and primary care so resources and care can be better aligned with people’s needs.",
